      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Anima Aesthetic\n\nAnima, 2B anime/illustration model (CircleStone Labs + Comfy Org). Not for realism.\n\n- **Tags:** lowercase, spaces not underscores (score_* keep underscores). Weights need to be strong, e.g. `(chibi:2)`.\n- **Artists:** prefix with `@`, e.g. `@artist name`.\n- **Order:** quality/meta/year/safety, 1girl/1boy, character, series, artist, general tags.\n- **Size:** 512 to 1536 per side.\n- **Samplers:** er_sde (flat, sharp), euler_ancestral (softer), dpmpp_2m_sde_gpu (more varied), euler.\n"
      ]
    }
